{
  "slug": "kyrie-irving-is-doing-whats-best-for-him-says-nets-great-deron-williams",
  "postId": 74304,
  "title": "Kyrie Irving Is Doing What's Best For Him, Says Nets' Great Deron Williams",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:image {\"id\":513791,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/hi-res-141629231_crop_north.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-513791\"/><figcaption>Getty Images </figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Former NBA veteran <a rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.basketball-reference.com/players/w/willide01.html?utm_campaign=Linker&amp;utm_source=direct&amp;utm_medium=linker-\">Deron Williams</a> is gearing up for his boxing match against former NFL veteran Frank Gore on December 18 in Tampa, Florida.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>According to Bally Sports' Brandon 'Scoop B' Robinson, Gore is considered the underdog heading into the bout. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"Being an underdog, I'm cool with it,\" said Gore.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/ScoopB/status/1460660968694947842?s=20\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/ScoopB/status/1460660968694947842?s=20\n</div><figcaption><br><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Deron William did say that \"Frank looks good.\" \"The man is tough, no doubt about that.\" \"It's a good challenge for me.\" </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/ScoopB/status/1460660717967884304?s=20\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/ScoopB/status/1460660717967884304?s=20\n</div><figcaption><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>During their press conference on Tuesday, Robinson asked Williams, who he covered during his first season in Brooklyn, to share his thoughts about this year's Nets and <a rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.basketball-reference.com/players/i/irvinky01.html?utm_campaign=Linker&amp;utm_source=direct&amp;utm_medium=linker-\">Kyrie Irving</a>. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"Yeah, I have been paying attention a little bit, I haven't watched too much because I have e been preparing for [this fight], but from what I've seen they are still a good team without Kyrie [Irving], but they definitely need him. So I hope everything gets figured out, but as for Kyrie, he is doing what he feels is best for him.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/ScoopB/status/1460665814248529930?s=20\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/ScoopB/status/1460665814248529930?s=20\n</div><figcaption><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As for the Brooklyn Nets are preparing to play host to the Golden State Warriors later tonight. The game will be featured on TNT tonight and feature a matchup of former teammates <a rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.basketball-reference.com/players/d/duranke01.html?utm_campaign=Linker&amp;utm_source=direct&amp;utm_medium=linker-\">Kevin Durant</a>, Steph Curry, and <a rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.basketball-reference.com/players/g/greendr01.html?utm_campaign=Linker&amp;utm_source=direct&amp;utm_medium=linker-\">Draymond Green</a>. And according to <a href=\"https://landonbuford.com/2021/11/15/nets-kevin-durant-warriors-stephen-curry-really-want-to-beat-each-other-badly-says-insider/\">NBA insider Nick Matthews</a>, the CEO at The Sincere Group and the former manager of three-time NBA Champion Draymond Green. Curry and Durant want to beat each other badly. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Make sure you tune into that game tonight on TNT at 7:30 PM EST.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
